es/rolls.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"store__data\">\n                <div>Deboniars pizza</div>\n                <div>Willows</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"ratings-container\">\n            <div class=\"ratings__logo\">\n                <div>\n                    <img src=\"themes/custom/Timely-Tastes-Theme/images/star copy.png\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    4.7\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"ratings__data\">\n                <div>Approximately 4.7km away</div>\n                <div>Based on 400+ reviews</div>\n                <div>Saved 872+ Meals</div>\n            </div>\n\n\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"rates-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"rate-container\">\n                <div class=\"rate-type\">\n                    <div>Collection Experience</div>\n                    <div class=\"w-[26%]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    1.3\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n\n            <div class=\"rate-container\">\n                <div class=\"rate-type\">\n                    <div>Food Quality</div>\n                    <div class=\"w-[100%]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    5.0\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"rate-container\">\n                <div class=\"rate-type\">\n                    <div>Food Quantity</div>\n                    <div class=\"w-[70%]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    3.5\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"rate-container\">\n                <div class=\"rate-type\">\n                    <div>Food Variety</div>\n                    <div class=\"w-[50%]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    2