rkable ways. Install additional functionality and change the look of your site using addons contributed by our community.','','11.2.2'),(1540,_binary 'Next Steps','','11.2.2'),(1541,_binary 'Bookmark these links to our active Drupal community groups and support resources.','','11.2.2'),(1542,_binary '<a href=\"@drupal_events\">Upcoming Events:</a> Learn and connect with others at conferences and events held around the world.','','11.2.2'),(1543,_binary '<a href=\"@drupal_community\">Community Page:</a> List of key Drupal community groups with their own content.','','11.2.2'),(1544,_binary 'Get support and chat with the Drupal community on <a href=\"@drupal_slack\">Slack</a> or <a href=\"@drupal_chat\">DrupalChat</a>. When you’re looking for a solution to a problem, go to <a href=\"@drupal_support\">Drupal Support</a> or <a href=\"@drupal_answers\">Drupal Answers on Stack Exchange</a>.','','11.2.2'),(1545,_binary 'Displays announcements from the Drupal community.','','11.2.2'),(1546,_binary 'Reference for usage, configuration, and modules.','','11.2.2'),(1547,_binary 'List and edit site comments and the comment approval queue.','','11.2.2'),(1548,_binary 'Administer blocks, content types, menus, etc.','','11.2.2'),(1549,_binary 'Configure what block content appears in your site\'s sidebars and other regions.','','11.2.2'),(1550,_binary 'Create and manage fields, forms, and display settings for your content blocks.','','11.2.2'),(1551,_binary 'Manage form and displays settings of comments.','','11.2.2'),(1552,_binary 'Create and manage contact forms.','','11.2.2'),(1553,_binary 'Configure what displays are available for your content and forms.','','11.2.2'),(1554,_binary 'Manage custom view modes.','','11.2.2'),(1555,_binary 'Manage custom form modes.','','11.2.2'),(1556,_binary 'Manage menus and menu links.','','11.2.2'),(1557,_binary 'Create and manage fields, forms, and display settings for your content.','','11.2.2'),(1558,_binary 'Manage tagging, categorization, 