od)','','11.2.2'),(2728,_binary 'If the site is experiencing problems with permissions to content, you may have to rebuild the permissions cache. Rebuilding will remove all privileges to content and replace them with permissions based on the current modules and settings. Rebuilding may take some time if there is a lot of content or complex permission settings. After rebuilding has completed, content will automatically use the new permissions. <a href=\":rebuild\">Rebuild permissions</a>','','11.2.2'),(2729,_binary 'PHP APCu caching can improve your site\'s performance considerably. It is <strong>highly recommended</strong> to have <a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/apcu.installation.php\" target=\"_blank\">APCu</a> installed on your server.','','11.2.2'),(2730,_binary 'Successful','','11.2.2'),(2731,_binary 'This attribute should be explicitly set to Lax, Strict or None. If set to None then the request must be made via HTTPS. See <a href=\":url\" target=\"_blank\">PHP documentation</a>','','11.2.2'),(2732,_binary '@percent% (@remaining remaining)','','11.2.2'),(2733,_binary 'Your server is capable of displaying file upload progress, but does not have the required libraries. It is recommended to install the <a href=\"https://github.com/php/pecl-php-uploadprogress#installation\">PECL uploadprogress library</a>.','','11.2.2'),(2734,_binary 'Here you can find a short overview of your site\'s parameters as well as any problems detected with your installation. It may be useful to copy and paste this information into support requests filed on Drupal.org\'s support forums and project issue queues. Before filing a support request, ensure that your web server meets the <a href=\":system-requirements\">system requirements.</a>','','11.2.2'),(2735,_binary 'A clean, accessible, and flexible Drupal front-end theme.','','11.2.2'),(2736,_binary 'A clean, accessible, and powerful Drupal administration theme.','','11.2.2'),(2737,_binary 'An intentionally plain theme with no styling to demonstrate default Drupal’s HTML and CSS. Learn how to build a custom theme from Stark in the <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/theming\">Theming Guide</a>.','','11.2.2'),(2738,_binary 'A custom Drupal theme for Timely Tastes.','','11.2.2'),(2739,_binary 'Installed themeInstalled themes','','11.2.2'),(2740,_binary 'Screenshot for @theme theme','','11.2.2'),(2741,_binary 'default theme','','11.2.2'),(2742,_binary 'Settings for @theme theme','','11.2.2'),(2743,_binary 'administration theme','','11.2.2'),(2744,_binary 'Set @theme as default theme','','11.2.2'),(2745,_binary 'Set as default','','11.2.2'),(2746,_binary 'Uninstalled themeUninstalled themes','','11.2.2'),(2747,_binary 'Install @theme theme','','11.2.2'),(2748,_binary 'Install @theme as default theme','','11.2.2'),(2749,_binary 'Install','','11.2.2'),(2750,_binary 'Install and set as default','','11.2.2'),(2751,_binary 'Default theme','','11.2.2'),(2752,_binary 'Administration theme','','11.2.2'),(2753,_binary 'Use the administration theme when editing or creating content','','11.2.2'),(2754,_binary 'Control which roles can \"View the administration theme\" on the <a href=\":permissions\">Permissions page</a>.','','11.2.2'),(2755,_binary 'Save configuration','','11.2.2'),(2756,_binary 'Set and configure the default theme for your website.  Alternative <a href=\":themes\">themes</a> are available.','','11.2.2'),(2757,_binary 'You can place blocks for each theme on the <a href=\":blocks\">block layout</a> page.','','11.2.2'),(2758,_binary 'Tabs display toggle','','11.2.2'),(2759,_binary 'Note that the administration theme is still set to the %admin_theme theme; consequently, the theme on this page remains unchanged. All non-administrative sections of the site, however, will show the selected %selected_theme theme by default.','','11.2.2'),(2760,_binary 'The configuration options have been saved.','','11.2.2'),(2761,_binary 'Provides an improved drop-down menu interface to the site Toolbar.','','11.2.2'),(2762,_binary 'Adds menu links like Flush cache, Run cron, Run updates, and Logout under Drupal icon.','','11.2.2'),(2763,_binary '@lifecycle','','11.2.2'),(2764,_binary 'View information on the @lifecycle status of the module @module','','11.2.2'),(2765,_binary 'Provides a workaround for the common problem that users with \'Use the administration pages and help\' permission see menu links they don\'t have access permission for. Deprecated from Drupal 10.3 and above.','','11.2.2'),(2766,_binary 'Provides search of Admin Toolbar items.','','11.2.2'),(2767,_binary 'Provides an automated way to run cron jobs, by executing them at the end of a server response.','','11.2.2'),(2768,_binary 'Allows banning visits from specific IP addresses.','','11.2.2'),(2769,_binary 'Sends pages using the BigPipe technique that allows browsers to show them much faster.','','11.2.2'),(2770,_binary 'Allows users to configure blocks (containing content, forms, etc.) and to place them in the regions of a theme.','','11.2.2'),(2771,_binary 'Allows the creation of content blocks and block types.','','11.2.2'),(2772,_binary 'Manages breakpoints and breakpoint groups for responsive designs.','','11.2.2'),(2773,_binary 'Provides the CKEditor 5 rich text editor.','','11.2.2'),(2774,_binary 'Allows users to comment on content.','','11.2.2'),(2775,_binary 'Allows importing and exporting configuration changes.','','11.2.2'),(2776,_binary 'Allows users to translate configuration text.','','11.2.2'),(2777,_binary 'Provides site-wide contact forms and forms to contact individual users.','','11.2.2'),(2778,_binary 'Provides additional publication states that can be used by other modules to moderate content.','','11.2.2'),(2779,_binary 'Allows users to translate content.','','11.2.2'),(2780,_binary 'Provides contextual links to directly access tasks related to page elements.','','11.2.2'),(2781,_binary 'Allows users to create menu links.','','11.2.2'),(2782,_binary 'Logs system events in the database.','','11.2.2'),(2783,_binary 'Defines field types for storing dates and times.','','11.2.2'),(2784,_binary 'Provides the ability to store end dates.','','11.2.2'),(2785,_binary 'Provides the capabilities to add fields to entities.','','11.2.2'),(2786,_binary 'Allows users to configure the display and form display by arranging fields in several columns.','','11.2.2'),(2787,_binary 'Provides a user interface for the Field module.','','11.2.2'),(2788,_binary 'Provides a field type for files and defines a \"managed_file\" Form API element.','','11.2.2'),(2789,_binary 'Filters text content in preparation for display.','','11.2.2'),(2790,_binary 'Generates help pages and provides a Help block with page-level help.','','11.2.2'),(2791,_binary 'Records which content users have viewed and marks it as new or updated.','','11.2.2'),(2792,_binary 'Provides an HTTP Basic authentication provider.','','11.2.2'),(2793,_binary 'Defines a field type for image media and provides display configuration tools.','','11.2.2'),(2794,_binary 'Places error messages adjacent to form inputs, for improved usability and accessibility.','','11.2.2'),(2795,_binary 'Allows users to translate interface text and to switch between interface languages.','','11.2.2'),(2796,_binary 'Caches pages, including those with dynamic content, for all users.','','11.2.2'),(2797,_binary 'Caches pages for anonymous users and can be used when external page cache is not available.','','11.2.2'),(2798,_binary 'Exposes entities as a JSON:API-specification-compliant web API.','','11.2.2'),(2799,_binary 'Allows users to configure available languages.','','11.2.2'),(2800,_binary 'Allows users to add and arrange blocks and content fields directly on the content.','','11.2.2'),(2801,_binary 'When enabled, this module exposes all fields for all entity view displays. When disabled, only entity type bundles that have layout builder enabled will have their fields exposed. Enabling this module could significantly decrease performance on sites with a large number of entity types and bundles.','','11.2.2'),(2802,_binary 'Provides a way for modules or themes to register layouts.','','11.2.2'),(2803,_binary 'Provides a field type for internal and external URLs.','','11.2.2'),(2804,_binary 'Manages the creation, configuration, and display of media items.','','11.2.2'),(2805,_binary 'Enhances the media list with additional features to more easily find and use existing media items.','','11.2.2'),(2806,_binary 'Provides a user interface for managing menus.','','11.2.2'),(2807,_binary 'Provides a framework for migrating data to Drupal.','','11.2.2'),(2808,_binary 'Provides a framework to migrate data from previous versions of Drupal into the site.','','11.2.2'),(2809,_binary 'Provides a user interface for migrating from older Drupal versions.','','11.2.2'),(2810,_binary 'Provides the MySQL database driver.','','11.2.2'),(2811,_binary 'New administration navigation','','11.2.2'),(2812,_binary 'Manages the creation, configuration, and display of the main site content.','','11.2.2'),(2813,_binary 'Defines field types with select lists, checkboxes, and radio buttons to select values from fixed lists of options.','','11.2.2'),(2814,_binary 'Provides the password checking algorithm for user accounts created with Drupal prior to version 10.1.0.','','11.2.2'),(2815,_binary 'Allows users to create custom URLs for existing paths on the site.','','11.2.2'),(2816,_binary 'Provides the PostgreSQL database driver.','','11.2.2'),(2817,_binary 'Provides functionality to output responsive images using the HTML5 picture tag.','','11.2.2'),(2818,_binary 'Provides a framework for exposing REST resources.','','11.2.2'),(2819,_binary 'Allows users to create search pages based on plugins provided by other modules.','','11.2.2'),(2820,_binary 'Provides a service for converting data to and from formats such as JSON and XML.','','11.2.2'),(2821,_binary 'Allows users to directly edit the configuration of blocks on the curr